r Eur 100k was submitted and this item may be closed. The company now appears to be trading and self sufficient Follow up action: Request a SPA between former UBO (Patel) and current UBO Eric Gandy 11/15/2025: New item created requesting the SPA."},{"title":"Company Details","tag":"Operations","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-11-04","description":"The website footer makes reference to a separate Curacao entity PMSPORT N.V., which appears to hold a Kahnawake Gaming Commission licence. The website footer should refer to the applicant entity.","notes":"10/28/2025: Applicant`s reply: Please note that the company suspended the use of previous product. Another domain, Top.Casino is currently registered with GCB that company is planning to operate with. 10/28/2025: GC."},{"title":"Terms & Conditions","tag":"Operations","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-11-04","description":"There appear to be 2 separate sets of Terms & Conditions, one relating to Cre8 B.V., the applicant entity, and one relating to PMSPORT N.V., which appears to hold a Kahnawake Gaming Commission licence. There should only be one version of the T&Cs available on the website and it should related to the applicant entity.","notes":"10/28/2025: Applicant`s reply: The matter is not relevant anymore as referred to the product the company is not operating anymore. 10/28/205: GC."},{"title":"Share Purchase Agreement","tag":"Miscellaneous","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-11-21","description":"Please submit a SPA between former UBO - Mr. Patel and the new UBO - Mr. Gandy","notes":"11/19/2025: Applicant's reply: Kindly see the document attached in an Extra documents sections. RCL: SPA was submitted for Eur 70k. Approved."}]}]}]}